## Inference of fn and const bodies: assigns types to expressions and patterns. Follows `body.rs`
## and `body/methods.rs` of the reference type checker.
##
## A group of mutually referring definitions (`Groups`) is inferred together, bottom-up per
## expression. On a type mismatch a diagnostic is reported at the expression and inference goes on.
## Definitions without a declared type (fns without a return type or `uses` clause, consts without
## a type) are monomorphic within the group and generalized once it is inferred.
##
## Not ported yet: handler bodies and `with` items, the error and effect sets of bodies (their
## constraints are collected but not solved), match coverage, and trait constraints. Where those
## would decide a type, the type is `TyError`, which unifies with anything, so no diagnostic is
## made up.
